 "Cada regla entra con su clic y su sonido. La quinta entra y, en el clic siguiente, se tacha (efecto Tachar con «pop») mientras aparece el sello de «prohibida». La cuenta atrás de 5 minutos está parada hasta que se pulsa.": "Each rule comes in with its click and its sound. The fifth comes in and, on the next click, is struck out (Strike effect with a “pop”) while the “banned” stamp appears. The 5-minute countdown is stopped until it is clicked.",
 "REGLAS DE LA CASA": "HOUSE RULES",
