 "<span style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;font-size:40px;color:#39ff88;margin-right:18px\">04</span>Si la bola sale, saca quien no la tocó": "<span style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;font-size:40px;color:#39ff88;margin-right:18px\">04</span>If the ball goes out, whoever didn’t touch it serves",
