 "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"color:#ffd84d;font-size:26px\">⚡</span>12 puntos de luz y enchufes</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:30px;height:5px;background:#7fd6ff\"></span>Agua: cocina y baño</div>": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"color:#ffd84d;font-size:26px\">⚡</span>12 light points and sockets</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:30px;height:5px;background:#7fd6ff\"></span>Water: kitchen and bathroom</div>",
 "Los muebles se dibujan a mano alzada uno tras otro (Dibujar sobre formas con trazo a mano). A la derecha, la silla elegida en 3D, con una vuelta de cámara al llegar.": "The furniture is sketched freehand one piece after another (Draw over shapes with a hand-drawn stroke). On the right, the chosen chair in 3D, with a camera turn on arrival.",
