 "Opción B": "Option B",
 "Opción C": "Option C",
 "Lluvia de [mayo] — el charco guarda el [cielo] que nadie [mira].": "Gentle rain of [May] — the puddle holds the [heaven] that nobody [sees].",
 "Tu turno": "Your turn",
