 "<div style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#ff6b1a\">Pedalea suave mientras cambias</div><div>La cadena sube o baja de piñón solo si gira.</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;font-size:34px;color:#ff6b1a\">Pedal gently while you shift</div><div>The chain only moves between sprockets if it is turning.</div>",
